    "Browse the web in the in-app browser: open pages, read them, click and type. Stable and on by default. When off, the tool is removed from every conversation — the model does not see it at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Browse the web in the in-app browser: open pages, read them, click and type. Stable and on by default. When off, the tool is removed from every conversation — the model does not see it at all."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregledavajte web u ugrađenom pregledniku: otvarajte stranice, čitajte ih, klikajte i tipkajte. Stabilno i uključeno prema zadanim postavkama. Kada je isključeno, alat se uklanja iz svakog razgovora — model ga uopće ne vidi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリ内ブラウザでウェブを閲覧します：ページを開いて読み、クリックや入力を行います。安定しておりデフォルトでオンです。オフにするとこのツールはすべての会話から取り除かれ、モデルはその存在を認識しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在应用内浏览器中浏览网页：打开、阅读页面，点击和输入。稳定可用，默认开启。关闭后该工具会从所有对话中移除——模型完全感知不到它的存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在應用程式內建瀏覽器中瀏覽網頁：開啟、閱讀頁面，點擊與輸入。穩定可用，預設開啟。關閉後該工具會從所有對話中移除——模型完全不會知道它存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
