    "It relies on interfaces that are not published for this use. They may change or stop working at any time, and this feature may stop working with them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It relies on interfaces that are not published for this use. They may change or stop working at any time, and this feature may stop working with them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它依赖并非为此用途公开的接口。这些接口可能随时变更或停止服务，本功能也会随之失效。"
