    "Let the assistant hand self-contained sub-tasks to an agent that works in its own hidden session and reports back. While an agent runs it appears in the tool bar; tap it to watch or stop it. Turning this off removes the delegate_task tool from every conversation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let the assistant hand self-contained sub-tasks to an agent that works in its own hidden session and reports back. While an agent runs it appears in the tool bar; tap it to watch or stop it. Turning this off removes the delegate_task tool from every conversation."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dopustite asistentu da zaokružene podzadatke preda agentu koji radi u vlastitoj skrivenoj sesiji i javlja rezultat. Dok se agent izvodi, prikazuje se u traci alata; dodirnite ga da biste ga pratili ili zaustavili. Isključivanjem se alat delegate_task uklanja iz svakog razgovora."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アシスタントが独立したサブタスクをエージェントに任せ、非表示の子セッションで実行して結果を報告できるようにします。実行中のエージェントはツールバーに表示され、タップすると確認や停止ができます。オフにすると、すべての会話から delegate_task ツールが外れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许助手把独立的子任务交给代理任务，在隐藏的子会话里完成后汇报结果。代理任务运行时会显示在工具栏中，点击可查看或停止。关闭后所有对话都不再提供 delegate_task 工具。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允許助手把獨立的子任務交給代理任務，在隱藏的子對話中完成後回報結果。代理任務執行時會顯示在工具列中，點一下可查看或停止。關閉後所有對話都不再提供 delegate_task 工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
