    "Qwen on a third-party gateway: a bare root-level enable_thinking, with no extra_body wrapper and no thinking_budget. Relays commonly reject both of those with a 400, so this is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen über ein Drittanbieter-Gateway: nur enable_thinking auf Root-Ebene, ohne extra_body-Wrapper und ohne thinking_budget. Relays lehnen beides häufig mit einem 400 ab, daher ist dies die sichere Wahl für selbst gehostete vLLM/SGLang und OpenAI-kompatible Relays, die Qwen-Modelle bereitstellen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen on a third-party gateway: a bare root-level enable_thinking, with no extra_body wrapper and no thinking_budget. Relays commonly reject both of those with a 400, so this is the safe choice for self-hosted vLLM/SGLang and OpenAI-compatible relays serving qwen models."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen en una pasarela de terceros: solo enable_thinking en el nivel raíz, sin envoltorio extra_body ni thinking_budget. Los relays suelen rechazar ambos con un 400, así que esta es la opción segura para vLLM/SGLang autoalojados y para relays compatibles con OpenAI que sirven modelos qwen."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen sa third-party na gateway: payak na enable_thinking sa antas ng root, walang extra_body wrapper at walang thinking_budget. Karaniwang tinatanggihan ng mga relay ang dalawang iyon gamit ang 400, kaya ito ang ligtas na pagpipilian para sa self-hosted na vLLM/SGLang at OpenAI-compatible na relay na naghahain ng mga qwen model."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen via une passerelle tierce : uniquement enable_thinking à la racine, sans conteneur extra_body ni thinking_budget. Les relais rejettent souvent les deux avec une erreur 400 : c'est donc le choix sûr pour les vLLM/SGLang auto-hébergés et les relais compatibles OpenAI servant des modèles qwen."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen na pristupniku treće strane: goli enable_thinking na korijenskoj razini, bez extra_body omotača i bez thinking_budget. Releji oboje često odbijaju s pogreškom 400, pa je ovo siguran izbor za samostalno hostane vLLM/SGLang i OpenAI-kompatibilne releje koji poslužuju qwen modele."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen pada gateway pihak ketiga: enable_thinking polos di tingkat root, tanpa pembungkus extra_body dan tanpa thinking_budget. Relay umumnya menolak keduanya dengan 400, jadi ini pilihan aman untuk vLLM/SGLang yang dihos sendiri dan relay kompatibel OpenAI yang melayani model qwen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サードパーティゲートウェイ経由の Qwen：ルート直下に enable_thinking のみを置き、extra_body も thinking_budget も使いません。リレーはこの両方を 400 エラーで拒否することが多いため、セルフホストの vLLM/SGLang や、qwen モデルを提供する OpenAI 互換リレーではこちらが安全です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "서드파티 게이트웨이의 Qwen: 루트에 enable_thinking만 두고 extra_body와 thinking_budget은 사용하지 않습니다. 릴레이는 이 둘을 400 오류로 거부하는 경우가 많으므로, 자체 호스팅 vLLM/SGLang이나 qwen 모델을 제공하는 OpenAI 호환 릴레이에서는 이 방식이 안전합니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen pada gateway pihak ketiga: enable_thinking kosong di peringkat root, tanpa pembalut extra_body dan tanpa thinking_budget. Relay lazimnya menolak kedua-duanya dengan 400, jadi ini pilihan selamat untuk vLLM/SGLang hos sendiri dan relay serasi OpenAI yang melayani model qwen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen na bramie zewnętrznej: samo enable_thinking na poziomie root, bez opakowania extra_body i bez thinking_budget. Przekaźniki zwykle odrzucają oba te elementy błędem 400, więc to bezpieczny wybór dla samodzielnie hostowanych vLLM/SGLang i przekaźników zgodnych z OpenAI obsługujących modele qwen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen em um gateway de terceiros: apenas enable_thinking no nível do root, sem o invólucro extra_body e sem thinking_budget. Os relays costumam rejeitar os dois com um 400, então esta é a escolha segura para vLLM/SGLang próprios e relays compatíveis com a OpenAI que servem modelos qwen."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen pe un gateway terț: doar enable_thinking la nivel de root, fără învelișul extra_body și fără thinking_budget. Releele resping frecvent ambele cu 400, deci aceasta este alegerea sigură pentru vLLM/SGLang găzduite de tine și pentru releele compatibile OpenAI care servesc modele qwen."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen через сторонний шлюз: только enable_thinking на уровне корня, без обёртки extra_body и без thinking_budget. Ретрансляторы часто отклоняют и то и другое с ошибкой 400, поэтому это безопасный вариант для собственных vLLM/SGLang и OpenAI-совместимых ретрансляторов, обслуживающих модели qwen."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen บนเกตเวย์ภายนอก: ใช้ enable_thinking ที่ระดับ root เพียงอย่างเดียว ไม่มีตัวห่อ extra_body และไม่มี thinking_budget รีเลย์มักปฏิเสธทั้งสองอย่างด้วยรหัส 400 นี่จึงเป็นตัวเลือกที่ปลอดภัยสำหรับ vLLM/SGLang ที่โฮสต์เองและรีเลย์ที่รองรับ OpenAI ซึ่งให้บริการโมเดล qwen"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Üçüncü taraf ağ geçidinde Qwen: yalnızca root düzeyinde sade bir enable_thinking; extra_body sarmalayıcısı ve thinking_budget yok. Aktarıcılar bu ikisini genellikle 400 ile reddeder, bu yüzden kendi barındırdığınız vLLM/SGLang ve qwen modelleri sunan OpenAI uyumlu aktarıcılar için güvenli seçim budur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第三方网关上的 Qwen：仅发送根级 enable_thinking，不带 extra_body 包装，也不发 thinking_budget。中转站通常会因这两个字段返回 400，因此自建 vLLM/SGLang 及提供 qwen 模型的 OpenAI 兼容中转站应选此项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過第三方閘道使用 Qwen：只在根層放 enable_thinking，不使用 extra_body 包裝，也不送 thinking_budget。轉送服務常會以 400 錯誤拒絕這兩者，因此對自架的 vLLM/SGLang 以及提供 qwen 模型的 OpenAI 相容轉送服務來說，這是安全的選擇。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
