            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This feature is provided on an “as is” basis, without warranty of any kind. By continuing you confirm that you have read this notice and accept these risks entirely at your own discretion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本功能按「现状」提供，不附带任何形式的担保。继续操作即表示您已阅读本须知，并自行承担上述全部风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
