            "value" : "這則訊息及其之後的所有訊息都將被刪除，此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This message contains pasted content that can't be edited yet. Send a new message instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
