            "value" : "最多可定义 %d 个子代理任务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最多可定義 %d 個子代理任務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You declined the authorization request." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You declined the authorization request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你拒绝了授权请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your GitHub token is stored in the iOS Keychain on this device and is sent only to GitHub. Minis does not collect it and does not route it through any server of ours. A backup you export yourself can include it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your GitHub token is stored in the iOS Keychain on this device and is sent only to GitHub. Minis does not collect it and does not route it through any server of ours. A backup you export yourself can include it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GitHub 令牌保存在本机的 iOS 钥匙串中，且仅发送给 GitHub。Minis 不会收集它，也不会经由我们的任何服务器中转。你自行导出的备份可能包含它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GitHub 權杖儲存在本機的 iOS 鑰匙圈中，且僅傳送給 GitHub。Minis 不會收集它，也不會經由我們的任何伺服器中轉。你自行匯出的備份可能包含它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your access token is held in the iOS Keychain on this device and is transmitted only to the provider. Minis does not collect it and does not route it through any server operated by us. A backup you export yourself may contain it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your access token is held in the iOS Keychain on this device and is transmitted only to the provider. Minis does not collect it and does not route it through any server operated by us. A backup you export yourself may contain it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的访问令牌保存在本机 iOS 钥匙串中，且仅发送至服务方。Minis 不会收集该令牌，也不会经由我方运营的任何服务器中转。您自行导出的备份可能包含该令牌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的存取權杖保存在本機 iOS 鑰匙圈中，且僅傳送至服務方。Minis 不會收集該權杖，亦不會經由我方營運的任何伺服器中轉。您自行匯出的備份可能包含該權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your existing API keys were kept — the backup's keys matched credentials already on this device, so nothing needed to be overwritten." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine vorhandenen API-Schlüssel wurden behalten — die Schlüssel aus der Sicherung stimmten mit den bereits auf diesem Gerät vorhandenen Zugangsdaten überein, es musste nichts überschrieben werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your existing API keys were kept — the backup's keys matched credentials already on this device, so nothing needed to be overwritten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se conservaron tus claves de API existentes: las claves de la copia de seguridad coincidían con credenciales que ya estaban en este dispositivo, así que no hubo que sobrescribir nada."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Napanatili ang umiiral mong mga API key — tumugma ang mga key sa backup sa credential na nasa device na, kaya walang kinailangang palitan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos clés API existantes ont été conservées — celles de la sauvegarde correspondaient aux identifiants déjà présents sur cet appareil, rien n'a donc eu besoin d'être remplacé."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vaši postojeći API ključevi su zadržani — ključevi iz sigurnosne kopije podudarali su se s vjerodajnicama koje su već na ovom uređaju, pa ništa nije trebalo prepisati."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kunci API Anda yang ada tetap dipertahankan — kunci dalam cadangan cocok dengan kredensial yang sudah ada di perangkat ini, jadi tidak ada yang perlu ditimpa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既存の API キーはそのまま保持されました。バックアップ内のキーはこのデバイスの認証情報と一致していたため、上書きの必要はありませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기존 API 키가 그대로 유지되었습니다. 백업의 키가 이 기기에 이미 있는 인증 정보와 일치하여 덮어쓸 필요가 없었습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kunci API sedia ada anda dikekalkan — kunci dalam sandaran sepadan dengan kelayakan yang sudah ada pada peranti ini, jadi tiada apa-apa perlu ditulis ganti."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zachowano Twoje dotychczasowe klucze API — klucze z kopii odpowiadały poświadczeniom już obecnym na tym urządzeniu, więc nic nie wymagało nadpisania."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas chaves de API atuais foram mantidas — as chaves do backup coincidiam com as credenciais já presentes neste aparelho, então nada precisou ser sobrescrito."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cheile tale API existente au fost păstrate — cheile din copie corespundeau credențialelor deja prezente pe acest dispozitiv, așa că nu a fost nevoie să fie suprascris nimic."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ваши существующие ключи API сохранены — ключи из копии совпали с уже имеющимися на устройстве, поэтому перезаписывать ничего не потребовалось."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คีย์ API เดิมของคุณถูกเก็บไว้ — คีย์ในข้อมูลสำรองตรงกับข้อมูลรับรองที่มีอยู่บนอุปกรณ์นี้แล้ว จึงไม่ต้องเขียนทับ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mevcut API anahtarlarınız korundu — yedekteki anahtarlar bu cihazda zaten bulunan kimlik bilgileriyle eşleşti, bu yüzden hiçbir şeyin üzerine yazılmadı."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保留此设备上现有的 API 密钥——备份中的密钥与本机凭据一致，无需覆盖。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你現有的 API 金鑰已保留：備份中的金鑰與這台裝置上既有的憑證相同，因此不需要覆寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
