    "Each chat gets its own **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, and **browser** folders — wiped when the session ends." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Chat erhält eigene **workspace**-, **attachments**-, **offloads**- und **browser**-Ordner — werden mit Sitzungsende gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each chat gets its own **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, and **browser** folders — wiped when the session ends."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada chat tiene sus propias carpetas de **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** y **browser**, que se borran al terminar la sesión."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "May sariling **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, at **browser** na folder ang bawat chat — binubura kapag natapos ang session."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque conversation a ses propres dossiers **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** et **browser** — effacés à la fin de la session."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svaki razgovor dobiva vlastite mape **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** i **browser** — brišu se kad sesija završi."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap obrolan punya folder **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, dan **browser** sendiri — dihapus saat sesi berakhir."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各会話に専用の **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** フォルダ — セッション終了時に削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 대화마다 전용 **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, **browser** 폴더 — 세션 종료 시 정리됩니다。"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap sembang mendapat folder **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads**, dan **browser** sendiri — dipadam apabila sesi tamat."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Każdy czat ma własne foldery **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** i **browser** — czyszczone po zakończeniu sesji."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada chat tem suas próprias pastas **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** e **browser** — apagadas quando a sessão termina."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiecare chat are propriile dosare **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** și **browser** — șterse la încheierea sesiunii."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У каждого чата есть собственные папки **рабочая область**, **вложения**, **offloads** и **браузер** — они очищаются по окончании сессии."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แต่ละแชทมีโฟลเดอร์ **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** และ **browser** ของตัวเอง — จะถูกลบเมื่อเซสชันสิ้นสุด"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Her sohbetin kendi **workspace**, **attachments**, **offloads** ve **browser** klasörleri vardır — oturum bitince silinir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个会话独立拥有 **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** 目录 — 会话结束时清理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個工作階段獨立擁有 **workspace**、**attachments**、**offloads**、**browser** 目錄 — 工作階段結束時清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each new backup is also copied to the selected folders — including servers connected in the Files app (SMB, WebDAV) and cloud providers. A folder that is offline is reported and skipped; the local copy is always kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede neue Sicherung wird zusätzlich in die ausgewählten Ordner kopiert — auch auf in der App „Dateien“ verbundene Server (SMB, WebDAV) und zu Cloud-Anbietern. Ein Ordner, der offline ist, wird gemeldet und übersprungen; die lokale Kopie bleibt immer erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each new backup is also copied to the selected folders — including servers connected in the Files app (SMB, WebDAV) and cloud providers. A folder that is offline is reported and skipped; the local copy is always kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada copia de seguridad nueva también se copia en las carpetas seleccionadas, incluidos los servidores conectados en la app Archivos (SMB, WebDAV) y los proveedores en la nube. Si una carpeta está sin conexión, se informa y se omite; la copia local siempre se conserva."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kinokopya rin ang bawat bagong backup sa mga napiling folder — kasama ang mga server na nakakonekta sa Files app (SMB, WebDAV) at cloud provider. Iniuulat at nilalaktawan ang folder na offline; laging napapanatili ang lokal na kopya."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque nouvelle sauvegarde est aussi copiée dans les dossiers sélectionnés — y compris les serveurs connectés dans l'app Fichiers (SMB, WebDAV) et les fournisseurs cloud. Un dossier hors ligne est signalé et ignoré ; la copie locale est toujours conservée."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svaka nova sigurnosna kopija kopira se i u odabrane mape — uključujući poslužitelje povezane u aplikaciji Datoteke (SMB, WebDAV) i usluge u oblaku. Mapa koja je izvan mreže prijavljuje se i preskače; lokalna se kopija uvijek zadržava."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap cadangan baru juga disalin ke folder yang dipilih — termasuk server yang terhubung di aplikasi Files (SMB, WebDAV) dan penyedia cloud. Folder yang offline akan dilaporkan dan dilewati; salinan lokal selalu dipertahankan."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しいバックアップは、選択したフォルダにもコピーされます。「ファイル」アプリで接続したサーバ（SMB、WebDAV）やクラウドも対象です。オフラインのフォルダは通知のうえスキップされ、ローカルのコピーは常に保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "새 백업은 선택한 폴더에도 복사됩니다. 파일 앱에서 연결한 서버(SMB, WebDAV)와 클라우드도 대상입니다. 오프라인 폴더는 알림 후 건너뛰며, 로컬 사본은 항상 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap sandaran baharu turut disalin ke folder yang dipilih — termasuk server yang disambung dalam apl Files (SMB, WebDAV) dan pembekal awan. Folder yang luar talian akan dilaporkan dan dilangkau; salinan tempatan sentiasa dikekalkan."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Każda nowa kopia trafia też do wybranych folderów — również na serwery podłączone w Plikach (SMB, WebDAV) i do chmury. Folder offline jest zgłaszany i pomijany; kopia lokalna jest zawsze zachowywana."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada novo backup também é copiado para as pastas selecionadas — inclusive servidores conectados no app Arquivos (SMB, WebDAV) e provedores de nuvem. Uma pasta offline é informada e ignorada; a cópia local é sempre mantida."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiecare copie nouă este trimisă și în dosarele selectate — inclusiv servere conectate în aplicația Fișiere (SMB, WebDAV) și furnizori cloud. Un dosar offline este semnalat și omis; copia locală se păstrează întotdeauna."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждая новая копия также отправляется в выбранные папки — включая серверы, подключённые в приложении «Файлы» (SMB, WebDAV), и облачных провайдеров. Недоступная папка отмечается и пропускается; локальная копия сохраняется всегда."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ข้อมูลสำรองใหม่แต่ละชุดจะถูกคัดลอกไปยังโฟลเดอร์ที่เลือกด้วย — รวมถึงเซิร์ฟเวอร์ที่เชื่อมต่อในแอป Files (SMB, WebDAV) และผู้ให้บริการคลาวด์ โฟลเดอร์ที่ออฟไลน์จะถูกรายงานและข้ามไป สำเนาในเครื่องจะถูกเก็บไว้เสมอ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Her yeni yedek, seçilen klasörlere de kopyalanır — Dosyalar uygulamasına bağlı sunucular (SMB, WebDAV) ve bulut sağlayıcıları dahil. Çevrimdışı bir klasör bildirilip atlanır; yerel kopya her zaman korunur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次新建备份都会同时复制到所选文件夹——包括在“文件”App 中连接的服务器（SMB、WebDAV）和各类云盘。离线的文件夹会被报告并跳过；本地副本始终保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個新備份也會複製到所選的資料夾，包括在「檔案」App 中連線的伺服器（SMB、WebDAV）與雲端服務。離線的資料夾會回報並略過，本機副本一律保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
