    "Each provider has its own privacy policy and terms of service that govern how they handle your data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder KI-Anbieter hat eigene Datenschutzrichtlinien und Nutzungsbedingungen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each provider has its own privacy policy and terms of service that govern how they handle your data."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada proveedor tiene su propia política de privacidad y sus términos del servicio, que rigen cómo tratan tus datos."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "May sariling patakaran sa privacy at terms of service ang bawat provider tungkol sa paghawak nila sa datos mo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque fournisseur AI dispose de sa propre politique de confidentialité et de ses conditions d'utilisation."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svaki pružatelj usluge ima vlastita pravila privatnosti i uvjete pružanja usluge koji određuju kako postupa s vašim podacima."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap penyedia memiliki kebijakan privasi dan ketentuan layanannya sendiri yang mengatur cara mereka menangani data Anda."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各AIプロバイダーには、データの取り扱いを規定する独自のプライバシーポリシーと利用規約があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 AI 공급자는 데이터 처리 방법을 규정하는 자체 개인정보 처리방침 및 서비스 약관을 가지고 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap pembekal mempunyai dasar privasi dan terma perkhidmatannya sendiri yang mengawal cara mereka mengendalikan data anda."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Każdy dostawca ma własną politykę prywatności i regulamin określające sposób przetwarzania Twoich danych."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada provedor tem sua própria política de privacidade e termos de serviço, que definem como tratam seus dados."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiecare furnizor are propria politică de confidențialitate și termeni care stabilesc cum îți tratează datele."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У каждого провайдера своя политика конфиденциальности и условия использования, определяющие порядок обработки ваших данных."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ผู้ให้บริการแต่ละรายมีนโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัวและข้อกำหนดการให้บริการของตนเองที่กำหนดวิธีจัดการข้อมูลของคุณ"
