    "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field." : {
      "comment" : "Voice provider credential note",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek benötigt App-ID und API-Secret – gib sie als „appId;apiKey;apiSecret“ im Feld API-Schlüssel ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek necesita el App ID y el API Secret: introdúcelos como \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" en el campo de clave de API."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kailangan ng iFlytek ang App ID at API Secret — ilagay bilang \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" sa API Key field."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek nécessite l’App ID et l’API Secret — saisis-les sous la forme « appId;apiKey;apiSecret » dans le champ Clé API."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek traži App ID i API Secret — unesite ih kao \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" u polje API ključa."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek memerlukan App ID dan API Secret — masukkan sebagai \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" di field Kunci API."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek には App ID と API Secret が必要です — API キー欄に「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」の形式で入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek에는 App ID와 API Secret이 필요합니다 — API 키 필드에 \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" 형식으로 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek memerlukan App ID dan API Secret — masukkan sebagai \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" dalam medan Kunci API."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek wymaga App ID i API Secret — wpisz je jako \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" w polu klucza API."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O iFlytek precisa de App ID e API Secret — digite-os como \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" no campo da chave de API."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek are nevoie de App ID și API Secret — introdu-le ca \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" în câmpul cheii API."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek требует App ID и API Secret — введите их как «appId;apiKey;apiSecret» в поле ключа API."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek ต้องใช้ App ID และ API Secret — ป้อนเป็น \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" ในช่องคีย์ API"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek, App ID ve API Secret ister — API Anahtarı alanına \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" biçiminde girin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讯飞需要 App ID 和 API Secret — 请在 API Key 字段中以“appId;apiKey;apiSecret”的形式填写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "訊飛需要 App ID 和 API Secret — 請在 API Key 欄位中以「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」的形式填寫。"
          }
        }
      }
