    "Keeps agent tasks running when the app is in the background. Shows progress via Live Activity on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island. Also turns on Background Speak so text-to-speech narration keeps playing." : {
      "comment" : "Footer under the Enhanced Background Execution toggle. Explains: keeps agent running in background, shows Live Activity, and that flipping this on also enables the Background Speak toggle so TTS narration survives backgrounding.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hält Agent-Aufgaben im Hintergrund am Laufen. Zeigt den Fortschritt über Live-Aktivitäten auf dem Sperrbildschirm und Dynamic Island. Aktiviert außerdem die Hintergrund-Sprachausgabe, damit die Text-zu-Sprache-Wiedergabe weiterläuft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keeps Agent tasks running when the app is in the background. Shows progress via Live Activity on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island. Also turns on Background Speak so text-to-speech narration keeps playing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantiene en ejecución las tareas de Minis Agent cuando la app está en segundo plano. Muestra el progreso mediante Live Activity en la pantalla bloqueada y la Dynamic Island. También activa la lectura en voz alta en segundo plano para que la narración de texto a voz siga sonando."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pinapatuloy ang mga agent task kapag nasa background ang app. Ipinapakita ang progress sa Live Activity sa Lock Screen at Dynamic Island. Ino-on din nito ang Background Speak para magpatuloy ang text-to-speech narration."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maintient les tâches de Minis Agent en arrière-plan. Affiche la progression via les activités en direct sur l'écran de verrouillage et Dynamic Island. Active également la lecture audio en arrière-plan pour que la narration vocale continue."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Održava zadatke Agenta aktivnima dok je aplikacija u pozadini. Prikazuje napredak putem Live Activity na zaključanom zaslonu i u Dynamic Islandu. Također uključuje govor u pozadini kako bi se čitanje teksta naglas nastavilo reproducirati."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menjaga tugas agen tetap berjalan saat aplikasi di latar belakang. Menampilkan progres via Live Activity di Layar Terkunci dan Dynamic Island. Juga mengaktifkan Bacakan di Latar Belakang agar narasi teks-ke-ucapan terus diputar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリがバックグラウンドでも Agent タスクを実行し続けます。ロック画面とDynamic Islandのライブアクティビティで進捗を表示します。バックグラウンド読み上げもオンになり、テキスト読み上げが再生され続けます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱이 백그라운드에 있을 때 Agent 작업을 계속 실행합니다. 잠금 화면과 다이내믹 아일랜드에서 진행 상황을 표시합니다. 백그라운드 음성도 켜져 음성 안내가 계속 재생됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mengekalkan tugas ejen berjalan semasa apl di latar belakang. Menunjukkan kemajuan melalui Live Activity pada Skrin Kunci dan Dynamic Island. Turut mengaktifkan Baca di Latar Belakang supaya naratif teks-ke-pertuturan terus dimainkan."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utrzymuje działanie zadań agenta, gdy aplikacja jest w tle. Pokazuje postęp przez Live Activity na ekranie blokady i w Dynamic Island. Włącza też czytanie w tle, aby narracja tekst-na-mowę grała dalej."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantém as tarefas do agente rodando com o app em segundo plano. Mostra o progresso pela Live Activity na Tela Bloqueada e na Dynamic Island. Também ativa a Fala em segundo plano, para a narração de texto para fala continuar tocando."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menține sarcinile agentului în execuție când aplicația este în fundal. Afișează progresul prin Live Activity pe ecranul blocat și în Dynamic Island. Activează și Vorbire în fundal, ca narațiunea text-to-speech să continue."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Поддерживает выполнение задач Agent, когда приложение работает в фоне. Показывает прогресс через Live Activity на экране блокировки и в Dynamic Island. Также включает фоновое озвучивание, чтобы синтез речи продолжал воспроизводиться."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ทำให้งานของเอเจนต์ทำงานต่อขณะแอปอยู่เบื้องหลัง แสดงความคืบหน้าผ่าน Live Activity บนหน้าจอล็อกและ Dynamic Island และเปิดการอ่านออกเสียงเบื้องหลังด้วย เพื่อให้การบรรยายข้อความเป็นเสียงเล่นต่อไป"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uygulama arka plandayken aracı görevlerinin çalışmasını sürdürür. İlerlemeyi Kilit Ekranı ve Dynamic Island'da Live Activity ile gösterir. Ayrıca metin okuma anlatımının sürmesi için Arka Planda Sesli Oku'yu açar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持 Agent 在后台运行。通过锁屏和灵动岛的实时活动显示进度。同时开启后台语音播报，让朗读不会被打断。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持智能體在背景運行。通過鎖屏和靈動島的實時活動顯示進度。同時開啟背景語音播報，讓朗讀不會被打斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
