    "Picked folders are bind-mounted at /var/minis/mounts/<name>. You can browse them in Browse Files and read/write them directly from the iSH shell, just like /var/minis/shared. Up to 10 folders can be mounted at a time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ausgewählte Ordner werden unter /var/minis/mounts/<Name> per Bind-Mount eingebunden. Sie können sie im Dateibrowser durchsuchen und direkt aus der iSH-Shell lesen/schreiben, genauso wie /var/minis/shared. Bis zu 10 Ordner können gleichzeitig eingehängt werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Picked folders are bind-mounted at /var/minis/mounts/<name>. You can browse them in Browse Files and read/write them directly from the iSH shell, just like /var/minis/shared. Up to 10 folders can be mounted at a time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las carpetas elegidas se montan con bind en /var/minis/mounts/<name>. Puedes explorarlas en Explorar archivos y leerlas o escribirlas directamente desde el shell de iSH, igual que /var/minis/shared. Se pueden montar hasta 10 carpetas a la vez."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ang mga napiling folder ay naka-bind-mount sa /var/minis/mounts/<pangalan>. Puwede mo itong tingnan sa Browse Files at basahin/sulatan nang direkta mula sa iSH shell, gaya ng /var/minis/shared. Hanggang 10 folder ang puwedeng i-mount nang sabay."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les dossiers sélectionnés sont montés en bind dans /var/minis/mounts/<nom>. Vous pouvez les parcourir dans le navigateur de fichiers et les lire/écrire directement depuis le shell iSH, comme /var/minis/shared. Jusqu'à 10 dossiers peuvent être montés simultanément."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odabrane mape montiraju se (bind mount) na /var/minis/mounts/<name>. Možete ih pregledavati u Pregledniku datoteka te ih čitati i u njih pisati izravno iz iSH ljuske, jednako kao /var/minis/shared. Istovremeno se može montirati najviše 10 mapa."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder yang dipilih di-bind-mount di /var/minis/mounts/<nama>. Anda dapat menelusurinya di Jelajahi File dan membaca/menulisnya langsung dari shell iSH, sama seperti /var/minis/shared. Maksimal 10 folder dapat dipasang sekaligus."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選択したフォルダは /var/minis/mounts/<name> にバインドマウントされます。ファイルブラウザから参照でき、Minis Shell からも /var/minis/shared と同じように読み書きできます。同時に最大 10 個までマウントできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "선택한 폴더는 /var/minis/mounts/<name>에 바인드 마운트됩니다. 파일 브라우저에서 탐색할 수 있고 Minis Shell에서 /var/minis/shared처럼 직접 읽고 쓸 수 있습니다. 동시에 최대 10개의 폴더를 마운트할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder yang dipilih di-bind-mount pada /var/minis/mounts/<nama>. Anda boleh melayarinya dalam Layari File dan membaca/menulisnya terus dari shell iSH, sama seperti /var/minis/shared. Sehingga 10 folder boleh dilekapkan pada satu masa."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wybrane foldery są montowane w /var/minis/mounts/<nazwa>. Możesz je przeglądać w Przeglądaj pliki oraz czytać i zapisywać bezpośrednio z powłoki iSH, tak jak /var/minis/shared. Naraz można zamontować do 10 folderów."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As pastas escolhidas são montadas por bind em /var/minis/mounts/<nome>. Você pode navegar por elas em Explorar arquivos e ler/gravar direto do shell iSH, como em /var/minis/shared. É possível montar até 10 pastas ao mesmo tempo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dosarele alese sunt montate prin bind la /var/minis/mounts/<nume>. Le poți parcurge în Explorare fișiere și le poți citi/scrie direct din shell-ul iSH, la fel ca /var/minis/shared. Se pot monta cel mult 10 dosare simultan."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выбранные папки монтируются по пути /var/minis/mounts/<name>. Вы можете просматривать их в «Обзоре файлов» и читать/записывать их напрямую из оболочки iSH, как и /var/minis/shared. Одновременно можно смонтировать до 10 папок."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "โฟลเดอร์ที่เลือกจะถูก bind-mount ที่ /var/minis/mounts/<ชื่อ> คุณเรียกดูได้ในเรียกดูไฟล์ และอ่าน/เขียนได้โดยตรงจาก shell ของ iSH เช่นเดียวกับ /var/minis/shared เมานต์ได้สูงสุด 10 โฟลเดอร์พร้อมกัน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seçilen klasörler /var/minis/mounts/<ad> altına bind-mount edilir. Bunlara Dosyalara Göz At'tan erişebilir ve tıpkı /var/minis/shared gibi doğrudan iSH shell'den okuyup yazabilirsiniz. Aynı anda en fazla 10 klasör bağlanabilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选文件夹将以 bind 方式挂载到 /var/minis/mounts/<name>。您可以在“浏览文件”中查看，也可以直接在 Minis Shell 中读写，就像 /var/minis/shared 一样。最多可同时挂载 10 个文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所選資料夾將以 bind 方式掛載到 /var/minis/mounts/<name>。您可以在“瀏覽檔案”中查看，也可以直接在 Minis Shell 中讀寫，就像 /var/minis/shared 一樣。最多可同時掛載 10 個資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
