    "Without encryption the backup is not protected — anyone with the file can read its contents." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne Verschlüsselung ist die Sicherung ungeschützt — wer die Datei hat, kann ihren Inhalt lesen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without encryption the backup is not protected — anyone with the file can read its contents."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin cifrado, la copia de seguridad no está protegida: cualquiera que tenga el archivo puede leer su contenido."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kung walang encryption, hindi protektado ang backup — mababasa ng sinumang may file ang nilalaman nito."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sans chiffrement, la sauvegarde n'est pas protégée — quiconque possède le fichier peut en lire le contenu."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez šifriranja sigurnosna kopija nije zaštićena — svatko tko ima datoteku može pročitati njezin sadržaj."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa enkripsi, cadangan tidak terlindungi — siapa pun yang memiliki berkasnya dapat membaca isinya."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗号化しない場合、バックアップは保護されません。ファイルを入手した人は誰でも中身を読めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "암호화하지 않으면 백업이 보호되지 않습니다. 파일을 가진 사람은 누구나 내용을 읽을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa penyulitan, sandaran tidak dilindungi — sesiapa yang memiliki filenya boleh membaca kandungannya."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez szyfrowania kopia zapasowa nie jest chroniona — każdy, kto ma ten plik, może odczytać jej zawartość."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sem criptografia, o backup fica desprotegido — qualquer pessoa com o arquivo consegue ler o conteúdo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fără criptare, copia de rezervă nu este protejată — oricine are fișierul îi poate citi conținutul."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Без шифрования копия не защищена — любой, у кого есть файл, может прочитать её содержимое."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "หากไม่เข้ารหัส ข้อมูลสำรองจะไม่ได้รับการป้องกัน — ใครก็ตามที่มีไฟล์นี้อ่านเนื้อหาได้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Şifreleme olmadan yedek korunmaz — dosyayı eline geçiren herkes içeriğini okuyabilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不加密时备份不受保护——任何拿到该文件的人都能读取其中的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未加密的備份不受保護，取得檔案的人都能讀取其中內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without encryption the backup is not protected, and API keys are left out — restored providers will need their keys entered again. Anyone with the file can read everything else in it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne Verschlüsselung ist die Sicherung ungeschützt und API-Schlüssel werden weggelassen — bei wiederhergestellten Anbietern müssen die Schlüssel erneut eingegeben werden. Wer die Datei hat, kann alles Übrige darin lesen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without encryption the backup is not protected, and API keys are left out — restored providers will need their keys entered again. Anyone with the file can read everything else in it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin cifrado, la copia de seguridad no está protegida y las claves de API se omiten: habrá que volver a introducir las claves de los proveedores restaurados. Cualquiera que tenga el archivo puede leer todo lo demás que contiene."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kung walang encryption, hindi protektado ang backup, at hindi kasama ang mga API key — kailangang ilagay ulit ang key ng mga na-restore na provider. Mababasa ng sinumang may file ang lahat ng iba pang laman nito."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sans chiffrement, la sauvegarde n'est pas protégée et les clés API sont omises — il faudra ressaisir les clés des fournisseurs restaurés. Quiconque possède le fichier peut lire tout le reste."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez šifriranja sigurnosna kopija nije zaštićena, a API ključevi se izostavljaju — vraćenim pružateljima trebat će ponovno unijeti ključeve. Svatko tko ima datoteku može pročitati sve ostalo u njoj."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa enkripsi, cadangan tidak terlindungi, dan kunci API tidak disertakan — penyedia yang dipulihkan perlu kuncinya dimasukkan lagi. Siapa pun yang memiliki berkasnya dapat membaca semua isi lainnya."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗号化しない場合、バックアップは保護されず、API キーも含まれません。復元したプロバイダーではキーの再入力が必要です。ファイルを入手した人は、それ以外の内容をすべて読めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "암호화하지 않으면 백업이 보호되지 않고 API 키도 포함되지 않습니다. 복원된 공급자에는 키를 다시 입력해야 합니다. 파일을 가진 사람은 나머지 내용을 모두 읽을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa penyulitan, sandaran tidak dilindungi, dan kunci API tidak disertakan — pembekal yang dipulihkan perlu kuncinya dimasukkan semula. Sesiapa yang memiliki filenya boleh membaca segala isi yang lain."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez szyfrowania kopia nie jest chroniona, a klucze API są pomijane — przywróceni dostawcy będą wymagać ponownego wpisania kluczy. Każdy, kto ma ten plik, odczyta całą resztę."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sem criptografia o backup não fica protegido, e as chaves de API são omitidas — nos provedores restaurados será preciso digitar as chaves de novo. Quem tiver o arquivo pode ler todo o resto dele."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fără criptare, copia nu este protejată, iar cheile API sunt omise — la furnizorii restaurați va trebui să introduci din nou cheile. Oricine are fișierul poate citi tot restul din el."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Без шифрования копия не защищена, а ключи API в неё не попадают — для восстановленных провайдеров ключи придётся ввести заново. Любой, у кого есть файл, сможет прочитать всё остальное."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "หากไม่เข้ารหัส ข้อมูลสำรองจะไม่ได้รับการป้องกัน และจะไม่รวมคีย์ API — ผู้ให้บริการที่กู้คืนจะต้องป้อนคีย์ใหม่ ใครก็ตามที่มีไฟล์นี้อ่านทุกอย่างที่เหลือได้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Şifreleme olmadan yedek korunmaz ve API anahtarları dışarıda bırakılır — geri yüklenen sağlayıcıların anahtarlarının yeniden girilmesi gerekir. Dosyaya sahip olan herkes içindeki diğer her şeyi okuyabilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不加密时备份不受保护，且不包含 API 密钥——恢复后的服务商需要重新填写密钥。任何拿到该文件的人都能读取其中的其他内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未加密的備份不受保護，且不會包含 API 金鑰，還原的服務商需要重新輸入金鑰。取得檔案的人可以讀取其中其餘所有內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
